KG42.register("clusters-d4fcfcd94784586e4c0e4b78",{"id":"26-battery_flexibility::v142-d-CL001","paper":"26-battery_flexibility","label":"Flexi User community surplus electricity trading, allocation, and revenue-and-expenditure interface","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL001","label":"Flexi User community surplus electricity trading, allocation, and revenue-and-expenditure interface","market_meaning":"Under the conditions of community participation permission, a renewable surplus electricity product, and no feeding to the grid, the community model jointly schedules power purchases, P2P trading, and private battery operation; the purchase price is used for trading, and buyer and seller revenues and expenditures are offset in the community objective. This candidate links trading permissions, quantity allocation, and qualitative payment consequences in series, and does not yet constitute a complete computable closed loop.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","pricing","clearing","activation","settlement"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"All referenced chains belong to Flexi User. R005's no-storage and no-interconnection conditions apply only to the independent pricing benchmark and do not replace R001's community optimization with private batteries and P2P trading; the qualitative input relation of the local price does not mean that it enters the community objective. The payment interface retains only the revenue-and-expenditure consequences stated by the source.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"Around the same set of community P2P quantities, assemble participation permissions, product boundaries, allocation constraints, trading, and internal revenue-and-expenditure offset. Independent household pricing has different computational conditions, is primarily attributed to CL002, and this cluster shares only its price interface; inter-chain mappings do not add execution order or scientific dependency edges.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the community cost objective, supply-demand and trading constraints, and private battery operating conditions."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Carries the execution meaning of the same traded quantity and the applicability of the purchase price; repeated flow formulas are not counted as a separate rule."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Clarifies the permission for consumers to participate in community trading."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Supplements the prosumer trading permission and the participation scope of the prohibition on grid feeding."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Defines the traded product and community boundary; its total quantity balance overlaps with the corresponding part of the trading formula."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Connects the revenue-and-expenditure consequences of P2P trading with the internal offset in the community objective, without providing transaction-by-transaction amount calculation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"References the independent pricing output as the purchase price interface; the price generation rule is primarily attributed to CL002."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01"],"rationale":"The same design definition simultaneously allows consumer trading and specifies a dynamic local price; the consumer permission completes the participant scope to which the trading price applies."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The prosumer permission and the prohibition on grid feeding define the entities and destination of surplus electricity trading, and are complementary to the intra-community trading scope of the execution chain."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The product definition constrains the surplus electricity traded by the execution chain and the community scope. R006-C003 corresponds only to Eq. (5) in R002-C004; the two complete constraint objects cannot be judged identical."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO004","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_X","v141-c-R001::x::x_X_p","v141-c-R001::x::x_I","v141-c-R001::x::x_I_p","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X001","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X002","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X003","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X004","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g01-e16","v141-b-g01-e17","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"The two chains reference the same model's household total, bilateral direction, and loss-adjustment relations, connecting allocation and trading meanings; this mapping does not prove that a separately described physical execution sequence exists."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO005","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::theta::p_p2p","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e16"],"rationale":"The source explicitly uses the adjusted shadow price obtained from the independent household benchmark for that household's P2P purchase price, supporting the interface from pricing to trading application; the adjustment arithmetic remains unclosed."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO006","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::theta::p_G","v141-c-R005::theta::p_p2p"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_G","v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_p2p","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g02-e21"],"rationale":"The source-defined grid price and local purchase price connect the pricing and community decision descriptions; the grid price enters the objective, while the local price retains only a qualitative input role and does not add an internal P2P objective coefficient."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO007","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e19"],"rationale":"The source links purchasing electricity from peers with buyer costs and seller revenue, supporting the functional assembly of trading and payment consequences, but does not support deriving a transaction-by-transaction payment formula."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO008","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e19"],"rationale":"The same paragraph explains the omission of the P2P term in Eq. (6) by the offset of intra-community payments and revenues, constituting a direct link between the accounting scope and the objective function."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM001","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R002::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R005::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R005::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16"],"rationale":"These nodes all refer to the M01 local P2P pricing function; only the display entry is unified, and the inputs, application roles, and edge bindings of the original chains are all retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM002","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R007::V::execution.energy_trade"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R002::V::execution.energy_trade","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e19"],"rationale":"Both places refer to Flexi User community P2P trading; the trading node referenced by the payment chain may share a display, while the payment conditions remain in the original chain."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM003","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_X","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X001","v141-c-R006::x::v141-c-R006-x-X"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"All are the total P2P sales quantity for the same household and time step; the local roles and domain descriptions of the allocation variable, trading flow, and product quantity are separately retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM004","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_I","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X003","v141-c-R006::x::v141-c-R006-x-I"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e17","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"All are the total P2P purchase quantity for the same household and time step; only identity is associated, and the local uses and domain descriptions of each chain are not merged."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM005","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_X_p","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X002"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g01-e16"],"rationale":"The definition, time step, household pair, and sales direction are consistent; these are different functional bindings of the same bilateral sales quantity."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM006","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_I_p","v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-X004"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e16","v141-b-g01-e17"],"rationale":"The definition, time step, household pair, and purchase direction are consistent; allocation and execution references remain independent."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM007","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::theta_psi_P2P","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P002","v141-c-R006::theta::v141-c-R006-theta-psi"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e16","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"All three are loss and conversion factors in the same M01 P2P sales-to-purchase relation; the parameter objects of each chain are retained, and no values are supplied."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM008","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_p2p","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P001","v141-c-R005::theta::p_p2p"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16"],"rationale":"The source definition and application description support the identity of the same per-household, per-time-step purchase price; the different local roles of derived price, qualitative decision input, and trading application are retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM009","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::theta_p_G","v141-c-R005::theta::p_G"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g02-e21"],"rationale":"All refer to the M01 exogenous dynamic grid price, with different uses in the clearing objective and the pricing benchmark; unit and calibration descriptions are not rewritten across objects."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM010","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g01-e16","v141-b-g01-e17","v141-b-g01-e18"],"rationale":"Both express Eqs. (2)–(5) of the same model, with different typesetting and functional bindings; the common community and no-grid-feed scope are retained, and repeated mathematics is not counted as an additional rule."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G001","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The source restricts battery charging to come from community DG, but R001's supply-demand inequality and storage dynamics do not separately restrict the charging source; the trading permission and product description also cannot prove that the prohibition on grid charging has been implemented in the mathematics.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C003","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e13","v141-b-g03-E03"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Have B/C supplement the charging-source constraint for the same mechanism or clarify its implementation; keep the existing formulas unchanged and do not replace the source restriction with a general energy balance."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G002","category":"math_incomplete","description":"Explicit sign domains for grid-purchase and P2P flows, the initial storage state, and terminal handling have not yet been given; the time description in Table 1 and the half-hour model description also require a unified unit interpretation. The existing content is insufficient to verify the complete mathematical implementation of the grid-feed prohibition and intertemporal scheduling.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::x_G","v141-c-R001::x::x_I","v141-c-R001::x::x_X","v141-c-R001::x::x_S","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C004","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e18","v141-b-g01-e20","v141-b-g01-e21","v141-b-g02-e11"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Supplement the source-supported variable domains, initial conditions, terminal handling, and unit conventions for power and energy per time step; do not set non-negativity domains or boundary values on your own."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G003","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R007 only describes trading revenues and expenditures and community offset, and does not provide amount definitions for transaction-by-transaction payments, seller revenue, or losses; the shared purchase price cannot automatically fill in these formulas.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g02-e16"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Clarify that this interface remains a qualitative accounting scope; if computable settlement is required, have B/C provide source definitions for buyer and seller amounts, price applicability, and loss handling."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G004","category":"ontology_extension","description":"Private battery physical operation and access scope are currently attached to existing functional nodes; v141-b-g01-p01 and v141-b-g03-P01 remain unapproved proposals.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e20","v141-b-g01-e21","v141-b-g03-E01"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-p01","v141-b-g03-P01"],"required_work":"Manual inspection should determine whether the existing bindings are sufficient and whether the proposals need approval; this time only references are retained, and no storage node is inserted."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G005","category":"unverified_source","description":"This cluster is assembled based on candidate evidence permitted by the experiment; the B evidence remains unverified, and no B source audit, C2 independent review, or Agent E check has been performed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e03","v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e19","v141-b-g02-e16"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check source transcription, inter-chain mappings, and applicable conditions item by item; candidate eligibility is not regarded as confirmation that the source or scientific correctness has been established."}]},"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R001","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R002","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R003","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R004","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R006","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R007","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R005"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-3fcd5e2d02ec7c3f","COMP-739917e3869e45a6","COMP-8c75001a94cd69f5","COMP-970463b73869ba14","COMP-a774da994c2ca212","COMP-aa07cfb9f341dafd","COMP-f8b6dd7cb8a348ad"]});
